{"4542390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Simon and Friends", "steam_appid": 4542390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras/f256d1227a5bd85c0087eff49b17f4b1.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/f256d1227a5bd85c0087eff49b17f4b1.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIMON AND FRIENDS</strong> is building upon the great classics of the turn based artillery shooter genre, while seamlessly weaving in more modern gaming mechanics to provide a familiar yet unique experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CLASSIC FEATURES AND MECHANICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand-painted 2D art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn-based local or online hotseat play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unit elimination deathmatch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wide variety of weapons and utilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Realistic wind, gravity and collision physics <i>(wind pending implementation)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destructible terrain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battlefield hazards <i>(pending implementation)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Airdrop supplements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras/d3671140aa5166541119fc5f75b545cc.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/d3671140aa5166541119fc5f75b545cc.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NEW FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unique teams - choose one of the four distinct factions, each with their own strengths and tactical playstyles <i>(2/4 currently available)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unique units - each team's unit is a unique individual with its own personality and dialogue, while maintaining team identity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lore flavor - each team and unit shares a history with the others, with interactions that play out both in matches and in supplemental story comics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Seasonal gameplay - each new season, in addition to a bigger balance and content patch, brings a next chapter of the ongoing story, leading into a fresh battlefield and brand-new character dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras/ba98629c34c0a61718b4fcc197b414ad.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/ba98629c34c0a61718b4fcc197b414ad.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=699 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NEW MECHANICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kickback - many weapons when fired will also push firing unit into the opposite direction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Modifiers - separately usable weapon/unit effects that can last anywhere from current turn, to be automatically activated when conditions are met</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Traits - passive abilities and modifiers applied to team and/or individual units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">XP system - units accumulate experience through damage dealt, and can level up, boosting their stats and unlocking more powerful inventory items, modifiers and traits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Leader units - teams' units that always go first, can never spawn near edges and have increased default health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battlefield scraps - as the match goes on, various item scraps and coins can be dropped and collected <i>(pending implementation)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battlefield vending machines - various shop type objects that can additionally spawn in the field, allowing purchasing of health points or additional weapons <i>(pending implementation)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hired mercenaries - neutral units with its own inventory that can spawn in the field and be recruited by either team <i>(pending implementation)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras/5012184643ca244f14f3f7e2ebe55409.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/5012184643ca244f14f3f7e2ebe55409.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Additional new weapons, utilities, modifiers and traits are periodically added with each update to the game, to keep the meta ever evolving and fresh. And if some players are fond of the particular classic feel, each feature can (eventually) be individually toggled on and off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras/4e1f98e6ce212db85692e23be20264c4.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/4e1f98e6ce212db85692e23be20264c4.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discussions, bug reports, feedback, suggestions, or just wish to hang out with the community? Hop onto our Discord via link in the sidebar!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras/f256d1227a5bd85c0087eff49b17f4b1.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/f256d1227a5bd85c0087eff49b17f4b1.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIMON AND FRIENDS</strong> is building upon the great classics of the turn based artillery shooter genre, while seamlessly weaving in more modern gaming mechanics to provide a familiar yet unique experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CLASSIC FEATURES AND MECHANICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand-painted 2D art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn-based local or online hotseat play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unit elimination deathmatch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wide variety of weapons and utilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Realistic wind, gravi