7e2ebe55409.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/5012184643ca244f14f3f7e2ebe55409.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Additional new weapons, utilities, modifiers and traits are periodically added with each update to the game, to keep the meta ever evolving and fresh. And if some players are fond of the particular classic feel, each feature can (eventually) be individually toggled on and off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras/4e1f98e6ce212db85692e23be20264c4.avif?t=1786937755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/extras_big/4e1f98e6ce212db85692e23be20264c4.webp?t=1786937755 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discussions, bug reports, feedback, suggestions, or just wish to hang out with the community? Hop onto our Discord via link in the sidebar!</strong></p>", "short_description": "No heroes. No villains. Just friends. Pilot a diverse cast of characters through battles across destructible terrain. Level up your team to unlock more powerful weapons and tools. Utilize modifiers and traits unique to each unit to gain an edge. Winning optional. Chaos mandatory. Fun guaranteed.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/4ae598191757f06c0ec7607e294c6c0fa7143d8e/header.jpg?t=1786937755", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542390/bddbb223610f54f8b8d97e011e937d7454b0f91a/capsule_231x87.j